    "updated_at": "2018-05-30T07:20:26Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the feedback. If I read reserved environments correctly (and it's fairly likely that I don't), they are only passed to [set up a window environment settings object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#set-up-a-window-environment-settings-object) when [navigating across documents](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#navigating-across-documents:set-up-a-window-environment-settings-object), which (again IIUC) is not what iframes do.\r\n\r\nIs that correct? If so, where is the active service worker set for iframes?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
